<p class="lt-chem-55839"><img data-media-type="image/jpg" data-print-width="4.5in" width="500" class="internal" alt="Eq25.jpg" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/418389/Eq25.jpg?revision=1" /></p>

